# Scripture and satsang source

Player-facing and admin-authored **satsang content** (word-bank clues, Bracket City, 1% Club, quotes, connections, charitra, legal/spiritual copy) must follow:

- https://www.swaminarayan.faith/
- https://www.swaminarayan.faith/learning-resources/scriptures

Authoritative texts on that site: **Vachnamrut**, **Shikshapatri**, **Satsangi Jeevan**, and the related Hindu scriptures they publish. Spellings follow the Bhuj English translations (see `data/SATSANG_WORD_BANK.md`).

## Do not use

- BAPS guru lineage or titles (Pramukh Swami, Yogiji Maharaj, Shastriji Maharaj as “successors”, “Bapa” / “Bapa Shree” as a name for the guru)
- BAPS-only pilgrimage centres as if they were SKSS yatra sites (Bochasan, Atladra, Tithal, Gondal as BAPS mandirs)
- Akshar-Purushottam wording that treats Akshar as a living guru or “ideal devotee” person
- Any teaching that cannot be traced to the Bhuj scriptures above

## Do use

- Bhagvan Swaminarayan, the two Acharya gadis (Ahmedabad Nar-Narayan, Vadtal Lakshmi-Narayan), paramhansas named in the Vachnamrut, and places that appear in those shastras (Gadhada, Vadtal, Sarangpur as a *prakaran*, Loj, Chhapaiya, etc.)
- `SITE.scripturesUrl` when linking out to learning resources
